{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>You Can't See!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the world of a blind traveler, where every tap of your guide cane reveals the unseen. You navigate environments that are familiar or distant\u2014 home, subway, a bustling street\u2014illuminating objects through touch and memory.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Control Your Cane:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With each touch, your cane brings the world to life. Uncover objects that hold meaning, from a humming boombox to the scent of a flowering plant.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521660/extras/heart.gif?t=1745328070\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Collect Memory:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect significant objects, solve tactile-based navigation puzzles, and immerse yourself in an experience designed to replicate the challenge and beauty of moving through the world without sight. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521660/extras/radar.gif?t=1745328070\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore and Discover:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a game about exploration, adaptation, and finding warmth in the everyday. Through careful design, a rich soundscape, and intuitive mechanics, <strong>Blind Touch</strong> offers a unique perspective on discovery and perception.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521660/extras/playground.gif?t=1745328070\" /></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3521660?t=1745328070","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3521660?t=1745328070","capsule_i